DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261129
SUMMARY:Small Business Saturday
DESCRIPTION:Small Business Saturday falls on the Saturday after Thanksgivin
 g\, wedged between Black Friday and Cyber Monday\, and it was created by a
  credit card company. American Express launched it in 2010\, during the re
 cession\, to push some of the holiday weekend's spending toward small and 
 local businesses. Unlike the two days flanking it\, it has been formally d
 esignated by the United States Senate\, repeatedly and by name.\n\nhttps:/
 /todaycelebrates.com/holiday/small-business-saturday/
